{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"title":"State Management","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides a state management system modeled after SwiftUI. When state changes, the view tree is automatically re-rendered."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"@State","anchor":"State"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/State"},{"text":" for simple values owned by a single view:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct CounterView: View {","    @State var count = 0","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Count: \\(count)\")","            Button(\"Increment\") {","                count += 1  \/\/ Triggers re-render","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Binding","anchor":"Binding"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Binding","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" provides a two-way connection to a value owned elsewhere. Use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"$","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" prefix on a ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property to get its binding:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct ParentView: View {","    @State var selectedIndex = 0","","    var body: some View {","        Menu(items: menuItems, selection: $selectedIndex)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create constant bindings for previews or static values:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let binding = Binding.constant(42)"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"@Environment","anchor":"Environment"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/EnvironmentValues"},{"type":"text","text":" provides values propagated down the view hierarchy:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct MyView: View {","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    @Environment(\\.statusBar) var statusBar","","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Themed text\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.foreground)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Defining Custom Environment Keys","level":3,"anchor":"Defining-Custom-Environment-Keys","type":"heading"},{"code":["struct MyCustomKey: EnvironmentKey {","    static var defaultValue: String = \"default\"","}","","extension EnvironmentValues {","    var myCustomValue: String {","        get { self[MyCustomKey.self] }","        set { self[MyCustomKey.self] = newValue }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inject values with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".environment()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["ContentView()","    .environment(\\.myCustomValue, \"custom\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"@AppStorage","level":2,"anchor":"AppStorage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppStorage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" persists values across app launches using the application’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runtime-owned storage backend. TUIkit apps use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/JSONFileStorage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" by default:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct SettingsView: View {","    @AppStorage(\"username\") var username = \"Guest\"","","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Hello, \\(username)!\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass an explicit backend when a property wrapper is created outside the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runtime or needs dedicated storage:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@AppStorage(\"username\", storage: MyStorageBackend()) var username = \"Guest\""]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-State-Survives-Re-Rendering","text":"How State Survives Re-Rendering","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit re-evaluates the entire view tree on every frame. When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" is called, views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reconstructed from scratch. Despite this, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" values persist: they are never reset"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to their initial value."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Structural-Identity","text":"Structural Identity","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each view in the tree has a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"structural identity"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": a path like "},{"code":"\"ContentView\/VStack.0\/Menu\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This path is built automatically during rendering based on:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The view’s type name","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Its position among siblings (child index)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conditional branches ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"if"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"else"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Nested modifier and runtime slots","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Persistent-State-Storage","text":"Persistent State Storage","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" values live in the owning runtime’s "},{"code":"StateStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", keyed by:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The view’s structural identity","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The property’s declaration index within the view (0, 1, 2, …)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State var count = 0"},{"type":"text","text":" is constructed, it initially holds the declared default."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Immediately before the renderer evaluates that view’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":", it binds each direct dynamic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property to the persistent location at the view’s final structural identity. A reconstructed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view therefore reads the stored value instead of resetting to its default."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Re-Render-Trigger","text":"Re-Render Trigger","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/State","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" value changes:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateBox"},{"type":"text","text":" sends a subtree invalidation to its runtime’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderInvalidationSink"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That runtime’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":" notifies the observer registered by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppRunner"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The main loop re-evaluates "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"app.body"},{"type":"text","text":" fresh: reconstructing all views"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The renderer rebinds each view’s dynamic properties to the same runtime’s "},{"code":"StateStorage","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The owning runtime clears the affected cached subtree and writes the new "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FrameBuffer"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Observable dependencies read while evaluating ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"text":" are tracked at the same committed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity. Re-evaluating an identity replaces its active observation generation, so callbacks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from earlier view values become inert. Registrations are removed when their identity unmounts.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Garbage-Collection","text":"Garbage Collection","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Views that disappear from the tree (e.g., a conditional branch switches) have their state","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"automatically cleaned up at the end of each render pass. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ConditionalView"},{"text":" also immediately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"invalidates the inactive branch’s state to prevent stale values.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is simple and predictable: the view tree is fully re-evaluated each frame (no virtual DOM), with persistent state. Terminal output is then diffed at the line level: only changed lines are written. See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderCycle"},{"type":"text","text":" for details on the output optimization pipeline."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Manage reactive state in your TUIkit application."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/statemanagement"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","generated":true,"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"]}],"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/EnvironmentValues":{"kind":"symbol","title":"EnvironmentValues","abstract":[{"text":"A collection of environment values propagated through the view hierarchy.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/environmentvalues","t